  "comment": "Ada error Starting VirtualBox kernel modules ...failed! (modprobe vboxdrv failed. Please use 'dmesg' to find out why) It also was caused by UEFI boot. The solution is quite simple: Reboot your machine and enter the BIOS Menu (In my case pressing F2) Search for Secure Boot and change to Legacy In an ASUS motherboard: Go to the Advanced Mode (F7) Go in the Secure Boot option under the Boot section",
